{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_ttr_30_1","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_30","textTraditional":"【經】","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_ttr_30_2","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_30","textTraditional":"元年春王正月。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_ttr_30_3","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_30","textTraditional":"三月，夫人孫于齊。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_ttr_30_4","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_30","textTraditional":"夏，單伯送王姬。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_ttr_30_5","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_30","textTraditional":"秋，築王姬之館于外。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_ttr_30_6","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_30","textTraditional":"冬十月乙亥，陳侯林卒。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_ttr_30_7","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_30","textTraditional":"王使榮叔來錫桓公命。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_ttr_30_8","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_30","textTraditional":"王姬歸于齊。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_ttr_30_9","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_30","textTraditional":"齊師遷紀郱、鄑、郚。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_ttr_30_10","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_30","textTraditional":"【傳】","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_ttr_30_11","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_30","textTraditional":"元年春，不稱即位，文姜出故也。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_ttr_30_12","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_30","textTraditional":"三月，夫人孫于齊。不稱姜氏，絕不為親，禮也。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_ttr_30_13","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_30","textTraditional":"秋，築王姬之館于外。為外，禮也。","sentenceOrder":13}],"overrides":{}}